OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin dry with
OL,6,Fsunny spells. Cloud will soon build
OL,7,Fbringing a few showers, these mainly
OL,8,Fin the north. These showers will clear
OL,9,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will start dry
OL,12,Fwith clear periods. Cloud and patchy
OL,13,Foutbreaks of light rain or drizzle
OL,14,Fspread east from late evening. This
OL,15,Fwill become heavy at times towards
OL,16,Fmorning.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FCloudy with light rain and
OL,19,Fdrizzle at first. Outbreaks of
OL,20,Fpersistent and locally heavy rain will
OL,21,Fspread east from mid-morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
